Latency: ${response.durationMs}ms
Payload Size: ${response.sizeBytes} bytes
Headers: ${JSON.stringify(response.headers, null, 2)}
Response Body:
${(response.rawText || "").slice(0, 1500)}

Provide a formatted markdown breakdown with clear headers:
